        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.103,
            0.552,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": "8.下面有关异染色质的叙述错误的是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.135,
            0.864,
            0.259
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "①异染色质在间期处于凝集状态；\n②雌性生物的一条 X 染色体常以异染色质的形式存在;\n③异染色质由高度重复碱基序列组成，不具有编码蛋白质的功能；\n④结构异染色质常位于着丝粒和端粒部位."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.267,
            0.548,
            0.29
          ],
          "content": "9.下面哪种细胞肌动蛋白含量最丰富:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.298,
            0.834,
            0.358
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "①脊椎动物骨骼肌细胞；\n②小肠消化道上皮细胞；\n③皮肤细胞;\n④在分裂过程中的植物细胞."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.365,
            0.943,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "10. I-细胞病患者成纤维细胞溶酶体内储积了大量未被降解的底物，这种病的病因是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.429,
            0.918,
            0.487
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "①GlcNAc 磷酸转移酶基因缺损；\n②低密度脂蛋白颗粒受体基因缺损;\n③信号肽酶基因缺损;\n④笼形蛋白基因缺损."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.496,
            0.925,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": "11. Which of the following changes takes place when a skeletal muscle contracts?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.527,
            0.46,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "①Z discs move farther apart;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.515,
            0.53,
            0.785,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": "②Actin filaments contract;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.559,
            0.46,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": "③Myosin filaments contract;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.517,
            0.563,
            0.816,
            0.586
          ],
          "content": "④Sarcomeres become shorter."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.594,
            0.909,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": "12.The sheep \"Dolly\" was cloned by introducing a nucleus from the mammary gland of a mature female sheep into an enucleated egg cell. Dolly, therefore, has:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.689,
            0.957,
            0.877
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "①A nuclear genome from one cellular source and an organellar genome from another source;\n②Nuclear and mitochondrial genomes from the same cellular source;\n③A haploid genome;\n④More potential to transmit genetic variation to her offspring than animals produced as a result of sexual reproduction."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.877,
            0.934,
            0.969,
            0.956
          ],
          "content": "第3页"
